<title>USA: Lancer Orthodontics sees lower Q4 shr.</title>
<headline>Lancer Orthodontics sees lower Q4 shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARCOS, Calif 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancer Orthodontics Inc expects fourth-quarter earnings to exceed $125,000, or $0.06 per share, compared with $0.11 for the same quarter a year ago, a company spokesman said Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Its due to lower sales across the board,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The spokesman also said the company's overall liabilities will total about $800,000, the lowest levels in 20 years.</p>
<p>Lancer, a subsidiary of Biomerica Inc, expects to report earnings in late August 1997.</p>
<p>The company makes orthodontic products.</p>
</text>
